# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# File:        .gitignore
# Assignment:  DSO202 Assignment 4 - GitOps Delivery of the Task Tracker
# Descriptor:  4.4.1 (secrets in a GitOps repository)
# Purpose:     Keep key material and plaintext Secrets out of Git by accident.
#              This is a safety net only. The proof that no credential was
#              committed is the history search recorded in docs/evidence.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Sealed Secrets private keys and their backups (the backup lives OUTSIDE the repo)
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
sealed-secrets-key*.yaml
*-key-backup*.yaml

# Plaintext Secret manifests and env files that could hold credentials
*.secret.yaml
*-secret.yaml
*.unsealed.yaml
*.env
.env*

# Rendered output and local tool state
rendered/
*.tgz
charts/*/charts/
.kube/
kubeconfig*

# Editor and OS files
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
